@startuml
!include common-style.puml

title Testing Strategy\n4N Clinic Management System

top to bottom direction

skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 13
  RoundCorner 10
}

rectangle "Requirements\nREQ-01..30 / UC01..35 / BR-01..29" as Req #DBEAFE
rectangle "Design Review\nDB schema / API contract / UI spec" as Design #CCFBF1
rectangle "Unit Testing\nService layer logic (limited coverage)" as Unit #FEF9C3
rectangle "API / E2E Testing\nPhase 1 — 3 suites / 104 tests" as E2E #DCFCE7
rectangle "Manual UI Testing\nPer-screen checklist + screenshots" as Manual #FFEDD5
rectangle "Regression Testing\nPhase 1 re-run after Phase 2 changes" as Reg #FCE7F3
rectangle "Acceptance Evidence\nPass/fail table + test logs" as Accept #F1F5F9

Req -down-> Design : drives
Design -down-> Unit : informs
Unit -down-> E2E : escalates to
E2E -down-> Manual : UI workflow coverage
Manual -down-> Reg : regression trigger
Reg -down-> Accept : report evidence

note right of E2E
Phase 1 E2E suites:
1. auth.e2e-spec.ts
   Login + RBAC (5 roles)
2. clinic-flow.e2e-spec.ts
   UC07-UC13 core flow
3. billing-catalog-flow.e2e-spec.ts
   Invoice + catalog
Result: 104/104 PASSED
end note

note right of Manual
Phase 2 testing approach:
- Manual test per feature screen
- Screenshot evidence
- No automated E2E yet
end note

note right of Unit
Current coverage:
- app.controller.spec.ts (boilerplate)
- No service-layer unit tests
- Planned for future sprint
end note

@enduml
